---

<section id="about" class="py-16 border-b border-[#1d1d1b] reveal-on-scroll">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header Micro-Label -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1d1d1b] pb-2 mb-8">
      <span class="micro-label text-[#c03f13]">SECTION 01 // ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</span>
      <span class="micro-label text-[#69645f]">EDITORIAL BIOGRAPHY</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Drop Cap Bio Block Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
      
      <!-- Right/Top Column: Big Canopee Headline Banner -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <h2 class="heading-canopee text-[40px] sm:text-[56px] md:text-[68px] lg:text-[76px] text-[#1d1d1b] leading-[0.80] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 uppercase">
          DEVELOPING INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS & SCALABLE WEB APPLICATIONS.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-domaine text-lg md:text-xl text-[#69645f] leading-snug italic">
          B.Tech CS & Engineering student bridging full-stack software architecture with modern AI solutions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Left Column: Drop Cap Paragraph (Miranda Bio Block Style) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-2 lg:order-1 flex flex-col gap-6 font-editorial text-lg md:text-xl text-[#1d1d1b] leading-[1.38] font-light">
        <p class="drop-cap">
          Driven Computer Science Engineering student with expertise in web development and artificial intelligence. Skilled in JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, Java, C++, SQL, HTML, and CSS, alongside robust cloud and developer tooling across AWS, GitHub, and Google Colab.
        </p>

        <p>
          Focused on engineering resilient backend services, lightning-fast static sites, and automated tools that address tangible challenges. Seeking a software development or AI engineering internship to contribute effectively and gain rich industry experience.
        </p>

        <!-- Stats / Highlights Table in Broadsheet Style -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-b border-[#1d1d1b] py-4 mt-2">
          <div>
            <div class="font-canopee text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#1d1d1b]">8.00</div>
            <div class="micro-label text-[10px] text-[#69645f]">VIT-AP CGPA</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-canopee text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#1d1d1b]">5+</div>
            <div class="micro-label text-[10px] text-[#69645f]">LIVE PROJECTS</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-canopee text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#1d1d1b]">08+</div>
            <div class="micro-label text-[10px] text-[#69645f]">CORE LANGUAGES</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
